{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "But in their selection of a constitution, the Briton newists have unfortunately allowed themselves but one deliberate assembly, and hence has sprung their present difficulties.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["But", " in", " their", " selection", " of", " a", " constitution", ",", " the", " Brit", "on", " new", "ists", " have", " unfortunately", " allowed", " themselves", " but", " one", " deliberate", " assembly", ",", " and", " hence", " has", " sprung", " their", " present", " difficulties", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "When do you intend that the John Bright shall start?", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["When", " do", " you", " intend", " that", " the", " John", " Bright", " shall", " start", "?"], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I wanted nothing more than to see my country again, my friends, my modest quarters by the botanical gardens, my dearly beloved collections.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " wanted", " nothing", " more", " than", " to", " see", " my", " country", " again", ",", " my", " friends", ",", " my", " modest", " quarters", " by", " the", " botanical", " gardens", ",", " my", " dearly", " beloved", " collections", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Never did he object to buckling up his suitcase for any country whatever—China or the Congo—no matter how far off it was.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Never", " did", " he", " object", " to", " buck", "ling", " up", " his", " suitcase", " for", " any", " country", " whatever", "—", "China", " or", " the", " Congo", "—", "no", " matter", " how", " far", " off", " it", " was", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I was well satisfied with my cabin, which was located in the stern and opened into the officer's mess.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " was", " well", " satisfied", " with", " my", " cabin", ",", " which", " was", " located", " in", " the", " stern", " and", " opened", " into", " the", " officer", "'s", " mess", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Now then, let's enter the city and enjoy the great feast that's being cooked. I'm nearly starving myself for this conquering kingdom's as hard work.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Now", " then", ",", " let", "'s", " enter", " the", " city", " and", " enjoy", " the", " great", " feast", " that", "'s", " being", " cooked", ".", " I", "'m", " nearly", " starving", " myself", " for", " this", " conqu", "ering", " kingdom", "'s", " as", " hard", " work", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Which thou dost scatter on every little blade of grass that springs, revives the milked cow, and tames the fire-breathing steed.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Which", " thou", " dost", " scatter", " on", " every", " little", " blade", " of", " grass", " that", " springs", ",", " rev", "ives", " the", " milk", "ed", " cow", ",", " and", " t", "ames", " the", " fire", "-bre", "athing", " ste", "ed", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Open thy heart wide and fold within the wet wings of thy dove.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Open", " thy", " heart", " wide", " and", " fold", " within", " the", " wet", " wings", " of", " thy", " dove", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "And though I have grown serene and strong since then, I think that God has willed a still renewable fear.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["And", " though", " I", " have", " grown", " serene", " and", " strong", " since", " then", ",", " I", " think", " that", " God", " has", " w", "illed", " a", " still", " renewable", " fear", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "I love thee with a love I seemed to lose with my lost saints. I love thee with the breath, smiles, tears of all my life, and, if God choose, I shall but love thee better after death.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["I", " love", " thee", " with", " a", " love", " I", " seemed", " to", " lose", " with", " my", " lost", " saints", ".", " I", " love", " thee", " with", " the", " breath", ",", " smiles", ",", " tears", " of", " all", " my", " life", ",", " and", ",", " if", " God", " choose", ",", " I", " shall", " but", " love", " thee", " better", " after", " death", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
